# Shared Obsidian vault — knowledge contract
The shared knowledge vault lives at ~/Obsidian/Brain. It is durable cross-agent memory.
- WRITE durable knowledge as you work: decisions + rationale → Knowledge/ or Projects/<name>/;
  end-of-task session digests → Sessions/<claude|codex>/YYYY-MM-DD-<slug>.md; project facts → Projects/<name>/.
