  `obsidian search query="..."` (app must be running) or plain grep over the folder.
- FORMAT: markdown + YAML frontmatter (source: claude-code|codex|openclaw · project · date ·
  type: decision|solution|gotcha|reference|digest), [[wikilinks]] between related notes.
