docs/proposals/BOSS-FIDELITY.md:24:## Current handoff: E3 Dynamo Crawler
docs/proposals/BOSS-FIDELITY.md:28:E3 preflight is complete at `artifacts/boss-fidelity/e3-crawler/preflight.md`. The source plate and current GLB are inspected; baseline desktop/mobile capture and original source banking are underway. Begin the next pass with exposed drive wheels inside the existing treads, substantial segmented electrical mast fittings, unequal stacks, wound copper capacitors and a framed dynamo window. Preserve three component names, damage morphs, gameplay state and the 12k geometry ceiling. Current exact runtime pin is 11,980 triangles; any changed measured count must update that admission guard.
docs/proposals/BOSS-FIDELITY.md:30:The Crawler's existing runtime forces warm atlas emission at intensity 2/3. Evaluate the revised materials in the actual encounter before accepting neutral renders. Damage pivots use normalized-coordinate constants: re-derive any affected pivot when moving geometry. The original plate depicts rail wheels while the ratified gameplay uses tracks; retain treads and expose their existing wheel rhythm. No E3 production source or asset has changed yet.
