# Rival Dynamo Crawler preserves three-component boss damage

The E3 Rival Dynamo Crawler render asset follows the same presentation boundary as [[Railcar GLB preserves component damage and disposes cleanly — 2026-07-14 0745]]. Factory code owns timing, attacks, collision, targeting, and disposal; the art package owns one stable GLB with named component meshes and damage shapes.

## Contract

- Source: `assets/raw/plate-e3-boss-dynamo-crawler.png`, SHA-256 `eb52e2b77695536c2216958daae45028f044c6a80757ff4450424f59a3dae086`. The shorter filename in the queue was shorthand.
- Output: base-centred 3.20 × 1.389 × 2.6775 GLB, 11,980 triangles, one material, one embedded 1024² atlas.
- Nodes: `drain_mast`, `tracks`, `capacitor_bank`.
- Morphs: `Damage_ToppledDrainMast`, `Damage_ShatteredTracks`, `Damage_RupturedCapacitorBank`.
- Final GLB SHA-256: `a336f7574d42ae6e1d69d13310fd549411c442e93073fec6a64ea0128f4f75f9`.
- Reopening the saved Blender file and exporting again is byte-identical and semantically identical.

## Visual lesson

Technical uniqueness is not enough. Two blind reviews rejected the first candidates as an underexposed utility cart with an open, lightweight chassis, ambiguous track/capacitor damage, and a flat stage-set gorge. The accepted model gained a deeper armored underframe, riveted track skirts with visible tread rhythm, structural rupture shapes, a bent river cut, continuous canyon rims, heroine scale, and an evidence-only drain arc.

The final blind verdict was SHIP. Remaining promotion debt is close-up mechanical density and noisy gorge texture around small silhouettes. Do not hide that debt with labels or runtime tint: every component failure must read in silhouette before effects.

## Boundaries

- The canyon, heroine, and drain arc are render helpers only and never enter the GLB.
- No `src/`, simulation, choreography, masks, or landmark files changed.
- Pressure Garden and Incline remain gated on factory-authored masks.
- The landmark freeze remains in force.
- Tripo/Gemini/ElevenLabs probes were blank; no external request or paid asset was used.

Related: [[Gold Rush MOC]], [[Armored Railcar damage reads before defeat — 2026-07-14 0658]].
